notes:        Original work for this repository, derived from the FilmCraft app icon (assets/app-icon/filmcraft.svg, referenced via <image>, not copied). Text is outlined Inter / JetBrains Mono glyph paths. Used for the Finder window of the macOS DMG; packaging/macos/dmg/generate.py renders it to background.tiff. See packaging/macos/dmg/README.md.
